Aligns the GitHub Actions workflows with cookieplone-templates: backend, frontend and docs checks run through the shared `plone/meta` workflows, the changelog check honours the `skip changelog` label and covers `devops/` and `docs/`, and Dependabot now reads its configuration from `.github/dependabot.yml` and labels its pull requests. The documentation link check runs again, and skips the virtual environment and npmjs.com. @ericof
